!Name: ship-c12d-separated
!C A period-96 Cordership based on individual switch engines.
!C This uses a forward-to-sideways reaction, many sideways-to-sideways
!C reactions, a fanout device to produce two adjustable output streams,
!C and a honey farm producing component.
!C No two switch engines in this pattern interact directly.
!C This is an improvement on previous versions of these spaceships.
!C David I. Bell, December 2018
!Source: jslife-moving
